{"municipality_code":"11301","pref":"埼玉県","city":"伊奈町","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"伊奈町には、小針内宿村、小針新宿村、羽貫村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場にまつわる場所が点在し、「大山遺跡」、「西光寺」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板に加え、小針内宿村や小針新宿村にゆかりのある旧境石標、村の歴史を紹介する案内板にも注目してみてください。 人物に目を向けるなら、武将・武士の松平信綱との縁をたどることで、街の歴史をより立体的に楽しめます。 「埼玉県県民活動総合センター」や「乗馬クラブ クレイン伊奈」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":4,"rank":1493,"percentile":19.4,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":21,"rank":685,"percentile":62.8,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":30,"rank":852,"percentile":53.4,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":4,"rank":1499,"percentile":15.1,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":1,"rank":1372,"percentile":15.9,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":1,"rank":1445,"percentile":12.5,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":9,"rank":1194,"percentile":34.9,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["松平信綱"],"tourism_landmarks":["埼玉県県民活動総